#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-compose.1:489
msgid ""
"Interrupted by INT or TERM.  Rootless overlay mksquashfs and its process "
"group are terminated directly.  During privileged capture, the marker is "
"created atomically before direct signal attempts, then the parent waits a "
"bounded interval for savechanges to terminate, reap, and clean its root "
"process group.  Private temporary output is removed through retained "
"descriptors."
msgstr ""
"Interrumpido por INT o TERM.  El overlay rootless mksquashfs y su grupo de "
"procesos se terminan directamente.  Durante la captura privilegiada, el "
"marcador se crea atómicamente antes de intentar señales directas, luego el "
"proceso padre espera un intervalo limitado para que savechanges termine, "
"recoja y limpie su grupo de procesos raíz.  La salida temporal privada se "
"elimina a través de descriptores retenidos."

